1
00:00:02,135 --> 00:00:04,125
Previously on The Big Bang Theory:

2
00:00:04,304 --> 00:00:06,294
Can I have your attention, please?

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:10,910
We're all here tonight because
we have no one to be with.

4
00:00:11,544 --> 00:00:14,984
We gotta stop defining our self-worth...

5
00:00:15,148 --> 00:00:17,408
...by whether or not we're in a relationship.

6
00:00:18,318 --> 00:00:20,408
We are a community...

7
00:00:20,587 --> 00:00:25,077
...and as long as we have each other,
we're never truly alone.

8
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:32,020
That was cool. What you said.

9
00:00:32,198 --> 00:00:33,568
Thank you.

10
00:00:36,202 --> 00:00:41,932
Uh, would you like to, uh,
get a cup of coffee?

11
00:00:42,108 --> 00:00:43,168
(Leonard:)Okay.

12
00:00:48,948 --> 00:00:50,578
Later, losers!

13
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:56,860
(Raj:)So then I went to Cambridge,
which was wonderful...

14
00:00:57,023 --> 00:01:02,023
(Raj:)...not only because it's a good school,
but because it totally looks like Hogwarts.

